{"unit_id": "tag:01QG:prose-0002", "translation": "\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\n下述引理（lemma）其实是再下一条引理（lemma）的一个特例，但似乎值得先指出它成立。\n\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "lemma", "target_term": "引理"}, {"source_term": "lemma", "target_term": "引理"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "lemma", "target_term": "引理", "context": "指下述引理。"}, {"source_term": "lemma", "target_term": "引理", "context": "指以本引理为特例的再下一条引理。"}], "notes": []}
{"unit_id": "tag:01QI:statement", "translation": "在情形（Situation）<REF_0001>中，典范态射（canonical morphism）<MATH_0001>将<MATH_0002>映入（maps）开子概形（open subscheme）<MATH_0003>，在其上<MATH_0004>可逆（invertible），且所有乘法（multiplication）映射（maps）<MATH_0005>都是同构（isomorphisms）（见《构造》中的引理（Lemma）<REF_0002>）。此外，映射（maps）<MATH_0006>也都是同构（isomorphisms）。\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "Situation", "target_term": "情形"}, {"source_term": "canonical morphism", "target_term": "典范态射"}, {"source_term": "maps", "target_term": "映入"}, {"source_term": "open subscheme", "target_term": "开子概形"}, {"source_term": "invertible", "target_term": "可逆"}, {"source_term": "multiplication", "target_term": "乘法"}, {"source_term": "maps", "target_term": "映射"}, {"source_term": "isomorphisms", "target_term": "同构"}, {"source_term": "Lemma", "target_term": "引理"}, {"source_term": "maps", "target_term": "映射"}, {"source_term": "isomorphisms", "target_term": "同构"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "Situation", "target_term": "情形", "context": "引用本引理适用的设定。"}, {"source_term": "canonical morphism", "target_term": "典范态射", "context": "指所引用情形中的态射。"}, {"source_term": "maps", "target_term": "映入", "context": "用作动词，表示把对象映入指定开子概形。"}, {"source_term": "open subscheme", "target_term": "开子概形", "context": "指满足所述可逆性和同构条件的子概形。"}, {"source_term": "invertible", "target_term": "可逆", "context": "描述所给对象在该开子概形上的性质。"}, {"source_term": "multiplication", "target_term": "乘法", "context": "修饰由乘法给出的映射。"}, {"source_term": "maps", "target_term": "映射", "context": "指由乘法给出的映射。"}, {"source_term": "isomorphisms", "target_term": "同构", "context": "描述所有乘法映射的性质。"}, {"source_term": "Lemma", "target_term": "引理", "context": "引用《构造》中的结果。"}, {"source_term": "maps", "target_term": "映射", "context": "指此外一并断言的映射。"}, {"source_term": "isomorphisms", "target_term": "同构", "context": "描述此外一并断言的全部映射的性质。"}], "notes": []}
{"unit_id": "tag:01QI:proof", "translation": "由命题（Proposition）<REF_0001>，存在整数（integer）<MATH_0001>，使得<MATH_0002>对所有<MATH_0003>均由全局截面生成（globally generated）。设<MATH_0004>为一点（point）。由上述结论，可取<MATH_0005>和<MATH_0006>，使<MATH_0007>和<MATH_0008>在<MATH_0009>处均不消失（vanish）。因此<MATH_0010>。由《构造》中的引理（Lemma）<REF_0002>得到<MATH_0011>，这正是所需的结论。由《构造》中的引理（Lemma）<REF_0003>（用于构造映射（map）<MATH_0012>）可知，映射（maps）<MATH_0013>和<MATH_0014>在<MATH_0015>的某个邻域（neighbourhood）内都是同构（isomorphisms）。由与代数（algebra）结构的相容性以及<MATH_0016>映入（maps）<MATH_0017>这一事实，可知所有映射（maps）<MATH_0018>在<MATH_0019>的某个邻域（neighbourhood）内都是同构（isomorphisms）。因此结论成立。\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "Proposition", "target_term": "命题"}, {"source_term": "integer", "target_term": "整数"}, {"source_term": "globally generated", "target_term": "由全局截面生成"}, {"source_term": "point", "target_term": "点"}, {"source_term": "vanish", "target_term": "消失"}, {"source_term": "Lemma", "target_term": "引理"}, {"source_term": "Lemma", "target_term": "引理"}, {"source_term": "map", "target_term": "映射"}, {"source_term": "maps", "target_term": "映射"}, {"source_term": "neighbourhood", "target_term": "邻域"}, {"source_term": "isomorphisms", "target_term": "同构"}, {"source_term": "algebra", "target_term": "代数"}, {"source_term": "maps", "target_term": "映入"}, {"source_term": "maps", "target_term": "映射"}, {"source_term": "neighbourhood", "target_term": "邻域"}, {"source_term": "isomorphisms", "target_term": "同构"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "Proposition", "target_term": "命题", "context": "引用保证全局生成的结果。"}, {"source_term": "integer", "target_term": "整数", "context": "指命题给出的整数。"}, {"source_term": "globally generated", "target_term": "由全局截面生成", "context": "指命题保证的生成性质。"}, {"source_term": "point", "target_term": "点", "context": "指证明局部同构性质时所取的点。"}, {"source_term": "vanish", "target_term": "消失", "context": "用于否定句，表示两个所给对象在该点均不消失。"}, {"source_term": "Lemma", "target_term": "引理", "context": "指《构造》中给出第一个所需断言的引理。"}, {"source_term": "Lemma", "target_term": "引理", "context": "指构造所述映射时使用的引理。"}, {"source_term": "map", "target_term": "映射", "context": "指使用后一个引理构造的映射。"}, {"source_term": "maps", "target_term": "映射", "context": "指首先证明局部为同构的两个映射。"}, {"source_term": "neighbourhood", "target_term": "邻域", "context": "指两个映射为同构的局部范围。"}, {"source_term": "isomorphisms", "target_term": "同构", "context": "描述两个映射在邻域内的性质。"}, {"source_term": "algebra", "target_term": "代数", "context": "修饰所用相容性涉及的结构。"}, {"source_term": "maps", "target_term": "映入", "context": "用作动词，表示像落在指定对象内。"}, {"source_term": "maps", "target_term": "映射", "context": "指最后一并证明为同构的映射。"}, {"source_term": "neighbourhood", "target_term": "邻域", "context": "指所有所述映射为同构的局部范围。"}, {"source_term": "isomorphisms", "target_term": "同构", "context": "描述全部所述映射在邻域内的性质。"}], "notes": []}
{"unit_id": "tag:01QG:prose-0003", "translation": "\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\n回顾《模（Modules）》中的定义（Definition）<REF_0001>，给定局部赋环空间（locally ringed space）<MATH_0001>、可逆（invertible）层（sheaf）<MATH_0002>和一个<MATH_0003>-模（module）<MATH_0004>，便有如下分次（graded）<MATH_0005>-模（module）\n<MATH_0006>\n下述引理（lemma）表明，在情形（Situation）<REF_0002>中，可由这个分次（graded）模（module）恢复拟凝聚（quasi-coherent）的<MATH_0007>-模（module）<MATH_0008>。另见《构造》中的引理（Lemma）<REF_0003>，其中证明了本引理（lemma）在<MATH_0009>这一特例下成立。\n\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "Modules", "target_term": "模"}, {"source_term": "Definition", "target_term": "定义"}, {"source_term": "locally ringed space", "target_term": "局部赋环空间"}, {"source_term": "invertible", "target_term": "可逆"}, {"source_term": "sheaf", "target_term": "层"}, {"source_term": "module", "target_term": "模"}, {"source_term": "graded", "target_term": "分次"}, {"source_term": "module", "target_term": "模"}, {"source_term": "lemma", "target_term": "引理"}, {"source_term": "Situation", "target_term": "情形"}, {"source_term": "graded", "target_term": "分次"}, {"source_term": "module", "target_term": "模"}, {"source_term": "quasi-coherent", "target_term": "拟凝聚"}, {"source_term": "module", "target_term": "模"}, {"source_term": "Lemma", "target_term": "引理"}, {"source_term": "lemma", "target_term": "引理"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "Modules", "target_term": "模", "context": "引用给出该构造的定义所在的篇章。"}, {"source_term": "Definition", "target_term": "定义", "context": "引用所回顾构造的定义。"}, {"source_term": "locally ringed space", "target_term": "局部赋环空间", "context": "指该构造的底空间。"}, {"source_term": "invertible", "target_term": "可逆", "context": "描述给定层的性质。"}, {"source_term": "sheaf", "target_term": "层", "context": "指给定的可逆层。"}, {"source_term": "module", "target_term": "模", "context": "指构造所需的给定模。"}, {"source_term": "graded", "target_term": "分次", "context": "描述构造所得模的结构。"}, {"source_term": "module", "target_term": "模", "context": "指构造所得的分次模。"}, {"source_term": "lemma", "target_term": "引理", "context": "指将要陈述的恢复结果。"}, {"source_term": "Situation", "target_term": "情形", "context": "引用恢复结果所依赖的设定。"}, {"source_term": "graded", "target_term": "分次", "context": "描述恢复所依据的模的结构。"}, {"source_term": "module", "target_term": "模", "context": "回指用于恢复的分次模。"}, {"source_term": "quasi-coherent", "target_term": "拟凝聚", "context": "描述可从分次模恢复的模的性质。"}, {"source_term": "module", "target_term": "模", "context": "指拟凝聚的待恢复对象。"}, {"source_term": "Lemma", "target_term": "引理", "context": "引用《构造》中处理特例的引理。"}, {"source_term": "lemma", "target_term": "引理", "context": "回指该特例所隶属的一般引理。"}], "notes": []}
